    46	     * <p>
    47	     * Uses {@code em.find} with a lock mode (JPQL {@code setLockMode} on a filtered query is not portable),
    48	     * then applies the soft-delete filter in memory. Locking a deleted row is harmless: it is released with
    49	     * the transaction.
    50	     */
    51	    @Override
    52	    public Optional<Court> findByIdForUpdate(Long id) {
